<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index drops 8.5 points to 905.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index drops 8.5 points to 905.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 8.5 points on Wednesday to 905 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eight of the ten sectoral indices fell, with the finance index falling the most, down 12.5 points to 1,314.3.</p>
<p>Food index rose the most, 13 points up to 1258.4.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
